From: Pear contributors
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] wine: record and stop actual native bootstrap before PE startup

Wine LGPL-2.1-or-later integration; retain upstream notices.
The new header carries an LGPL-2.1-or-later notice limited to this Wine
integration. Diagnostics use actual Wine loader/server paths and stop after
the first-thread server protocol, before guest x18/PE execution.

